    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clear The Board With The Fewest Clicks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623400/extras/db2b4d57d9c134bb0fd74f84542fd220.poster.avif?t=1750955264\" width=616 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623400/extras/db2b4d57d9c134bb0fd74f84542fd220.webm?t=1750955264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623400/extras/db2b4d57d9c134bb0fd74f84542fd220.mp4?t=1750955264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Orbs Orbs Orbs</strong> is a vibrant 2D precision clicker game. Clear the board by clicking to create a white ring that destroys the orbs. Unlock six distinct orb types across 55 levels\u2014each with its own physics movement.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Aim:\u00a0To clear the board with the fewest clicks in order to achieve a 3 Orb rating on each level.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Orb Types:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Green</strong> \u2013 The balanced all-rounder</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blue</strong> \u2013 Large and slow-moving#</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teal</strong> \u2013 Small, light, and nimble</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Orange</strong> \u2013 Floats with reversed gravity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Red</strong> \u2013 Unpredictable and chaotic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pink</strong> \u2013 Creates new orbs on collision</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every orb behaves differently, creating endless combinations of movement and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623400/extras/18ee83bbf1c875c397a7268b25c5d0d4.poster.avif?t=1750955264\" width=616 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623400/extras/18ee83bbf1c875c397a7268b25c5d0d4.webm?t=1750955264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623400/extras/18ee83bbf1c875c397a7268b25c5d0d4.mp4?t=1750955264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Puzzle Elements &amp; Mechanics:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Seesaws and moving platforms add to the challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Red zones destroy your white ring, and certain areas can't be clicked on</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Destructible green blocks can alter your approach</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Attraction and repelling zones manipulate the orbs movement</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need quick thinking, clever timing, and a little bit of chaos control to clear each board!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623400/extras/d0778524b5dfefdf1df43a9e4670bf7a.poster.avif?t=1750955264\" width=616 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623400/extras/d0778524b5dfefdf1df43a9e4670bf7a.webm?t=1750955264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623400/extras/d0778524b5dfefdf1df43a9e4670bf7a.mp4?t=1750955264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Relaxing &amp; Chaotic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With soothing ASMR-inspired sound effects and colourful, physics-based interactions, <i>Orbs Orbs Orbs</i> delivers a unique mix of relaxation and energetic puzzle-solving. Levels can be calming or wildly unpredictable depending on how many orbs are in play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Again:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your score is based on the number of attempts needed to clear the board.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must secure at least two orbs to progress\u2014but aiming for three is the ultimate challenge!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your personal best time and score </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're looking for a casual, meditative experience or a high-score buzz, <i>Orbs Orbs Orbs</i> will keep you clicking, strategizing, and coming back for more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring 11 Steam Achievements!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clear The Board With The Fewest Clicks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623400/extras/db2b4d57d9c134bb0fd74f84542fd220.poster.avif?t=1750955264\" width=616 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623400/extras/db2b4d57d9c134bb0fd74f84542fd220.webm?t=1750955264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623400/extras/db2b4d57d9c134bb0fd74f84542fd220.mp4?t=1750955264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Orbs Orbs Orbs</strong> is a vibrant 2D precision clicker game. Clear the board by clicking to create a white ring that destroys the orbs. Unlock six distinct orb types across 55 levels\u2014each with its own physics movement.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Aim:\u00a0To clear the board with the fewest clicks in order to achieve a 3 Orb rating on each level.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Orb Types:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Green</strong> \u2013 The balanced all-rounder</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blue</strong> \u2013 Large and slow-moving#</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teal</strong> \u2013 Small, light, and nimble</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Orange</strong> \u2013 Floats with reversed gravity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Red</strong> \u2013 Unpredictable and chaotic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pink</strong> \u2013 Creates new orbs on collision</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every orb behaves differently, creating endless combinations of movement and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623400/extras/18ee83bbf1c875c397a7268b25c5d0d4.poster.avif?t=1750955264\" width=616 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623400/extras/18ee83bbf1c875c397a7268b25c5d0d4.webm?t=1750955264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623400/extras/18ee83bbf1c875c397a7268b25c5d0d4.mp4?t=1750955264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Puzzle Elements &amp; Mechanics:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Seesaws and moving platforms add to the challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Red zones destroy your white ring, and certain areas can't be clicked on</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Destructible green blocks can alter your approach</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Attraction and repelling zones manipulate the orbs movement</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need quick thinking, clever timing, and a little bit of chaos control to clear each board!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623400/extras/d0778524b5dfefdf1df43a9e4670bf7a.poster.avif?t=1750955264\" width=616 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623400/extras/d0778524b5dfefdf1df43a9e4670bf7a.webm?t=1750955264\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623400/extras/d0778524b5dfefdf1df43a9e4670bf7a.mp4?t=1750955264\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Relaxing &amp; Chaotic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With soothing ASMR-inspired sound effects and colourful, physics-based interactions, <i>Orbs Orbs Orbs</i> delivers a unique mix of relaxation and energetic puzzle-solving. Levels can be calming or wildly unpredictable depending on how many orbs are in play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Again:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your score is based on the number of attempts needed to clear the board.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must secure at least two orbs to progress\u2014but aiming for three is the ultimate challenge!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your personal best time and score </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're looking for a casual, meditative experience or a high-score buzz, <i>Orbs Orbs Orbs</i> will keep you clicking, strategizing, and coming back for more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring 11 Steam Achievements!</p></li></ul>",
